# I2C scanner
# Level 3 - Sensors and motors
#
# Lists the address of every I2C device connected: the first thing to try when a display or sensor won't answer.
# You learn: the i2c library and printing a list.
# You need: any I2C module (display, sensor, clock): SDA to A4, SCL to A5, VCC and GND.

board uno
use mujard.i2c

at start:
    print "Looking for I2C devices..."

every 5 s:
    print "Found: {i2c.scan()}"    # for example [0x27, 0x68]
